x_{n}
\end{bmatrix}\right)=T_{A}\left(\sum_{i=1}^{n}x_{i}\cdot e_{i}\right)=\sum_{i=1}^{n}x_{i}\cdot T_{A}\left(e_{i}\right)=\sum_{i=1}^{n}x_{i}\cdot c_{i}
\]


