\begin_layout Proof
מתקיים:
\begin_inset Formula
\[
\left(Q^{-1}\cdot P^{-1}\right)\cdot\left(P\cdot Q\right)=Q^{-1}\cdot{\color{red}P^{-1}\cdot P}\cdot Q=Q^{-1}\cdot{\color{red}I_{n}}\cdot Q={\color{blue}Q^{-1}\cdot Q}={\color{blue}I_{n}}
\]


